---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  description="Guillaume Beardsell is a computational scientist and mechanical engineer with a Caltech PhD and a background in reacting-flow simulation and numerical methods."
>
  <p class="eyebrow">A little background</p>
  <h1 class="page-heading">About me</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    I’m Guillaume Beardsell, a computational scientist and mechanical engineer.
  </p>
  <div class="about-content">
    <div class="prose-content">
      <p>
        I have a PhD in mechanical engineering from Caltech. My background spans
        reacting-flow simulation, numerical methods, and scientific computing.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’m interested in how computational tools help us understand physical
        systems: how we represent the physics, solve the equations, and assess
        what a simulation can tell us.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site brings together my projects and technical writing. One current
        project is <a href="/projects/fogcast/">Fogcast</a>, an exploration of
        local clear-sky forecasting for the Bay Area.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find my public work on <a href="https://github.com/gbeardsell"
          >GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside aria-label="Areas of work">
      <p class="eyebrow">Areas of work</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Scientific computing</li><li>Numerical methods</li><li>
          Reacting-flow simulation
        </li><li>Mechanical engineering</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
<style>
  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 16rem;
    gap: 5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  aside {
    padding-top: 1.4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    align-self: start;
  }
  aside ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  aside li {
    margin-block: 0.6rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
